*__screenshots__/
# VRT baselines are the regression contract — they MUST be committed (override above).
# The glob must be `**/`: the kennisnet stories moved into their own folder, so the baselines now
# live at stories/kennisnet/__screenshots__/, one level deeper than the old un-nested path. A literal
# `!apps/e2e/src/stories/__screenshots__/` silently stopped matching them and nothing was tracked.
!apps/e2e/src/stories/**/__screenshots__/
# Vitest writes actual/diff images here on failure; never commit these.
